bottom quartile among Energy peers. Each employee generates $130K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $9K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 6\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (8/10).","financial_summary":["Flowco Holdings Inc. is a small-cap energy business with a $1.9B market cap on $760M of annual revenue.","Returns on capital run at 38% against a 10% cost of capital \u2014 a 28-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $167M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 22 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 7.11\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 0.6\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and interest coverage runs at 7.9\u00d7.","Shareholder yield of 2.5% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insiders hold 3.4% of the shares, and within its sector the business captures 1.8\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 9.6% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (77% sell ratio, net $191.7M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"The commodity cycle \u2014 revenue and free cash flow are ultimately hostage to a price the company does not set, and the long-run energy-transition arc adds a structural overhang.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"ESG-driven capital flight and stranded asset risk \u2014 tightening climate policy and investor mandates raise the cost of capital and risk leaving reserves permanently in the ground.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Geopolitical supply shocks \u2014 wars, sanctions, and OPEC decisions create volatility that no hedging programme can fully neutralise.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Shares offer a 21% margin of safety against estimated fair value","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Energy peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood","Energy sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter","Energy ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Flowco (NYSE:FLOC) EVP Sells 17,591 Shares of Stock","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/flowco-nysefloc-evp-sells-17591-shares-of-stock.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794611722.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.836,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Flowco Holdings Inc. (NYSE:FLOC) Shares Set to Pay Quarterly Dividend of $0.09","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/11/flowco-holdings-inc-nysefloc-shares-set-to-pay-quarterly-dividend-of-0-09.html","date":"2026-11-11","timestamp":1794411169.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.743,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings","dividend"]},{"title":"The Strong Earnings Posted By Flowco Holdings (NYSE:FLOC) Are A Good Indication Of The Strength Of The Business","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/energy/nyse-floc/flowco-holdings/news/the-strong-earnings-posted-by-flowco-holdings-nysefloc-are-a","date":"2026-11-11","timestamp":1794392994.051,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.961,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Flowco (NYSE:FLOC) Stock: Insider Alexander Chmel